The U.P. Habitual Offenders' Restriction Rules, 1957
(a)
"Act" means the Uttar Pradesh Habitual Offenders' Restriction Act, 1952;
(b)
"Inspector-General" means the Inspector-General of Prisons, Uttar Pradesh;
(c)
"Form" means a form appended to these rules;
(d)
"Government" means the Government of Uttar Pradesh;
(e)
"Restricted person" means a person against whom an order of restriction has been made;
(f)
"Section" means a section of the Act;
(g)
"Settler" means a person, confined in a settlement under the provisions of the Act.
